                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Really good start.  My daughter is taking percussion in school, and wanted to practice marimba at home.  This looks like a great substitute, and she immediately banged out Yellow Submarine and seemed right at home with the spacing, responsiveness, etc.  A way to import sheet music would be awesome (would probably have to appear quite a bit larger than the current music stand to be readable on the Vive, but virtual whiteboard sized or on the back wall would be great).",
